<title>SPAIN: Endesa 9-mth gp net profit up 11.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Endesa 9-mth gp net profit up 11.8 pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>Earnings per share (ptas)	  464.8     vs    415.8</p>
<p> Debt				     534.56    vs    626.44</p>
<p>NOTE: Endesa said its recently-announced investment in Sevillana and Fecsa would require a maximum investment of 200 billion pesetas, which would be financed with income generated during the year as well as debt.</p>
</text>
